# gridcraft 0.13.0: target_arch = "wasm32" means the browser build
# (apps/gridcraft-web) here; Kandelo takes the native paths (files opened
# by path, rfd, arboard). Every such cfg reads
# all(target_arch = "wasm32", not(target_os = "kandelo")). Kandelo has no
# X server, so the app asks eframe and winit for Wayland only there, and
# never switches to X11 when DISPLAY is set. arboard takes its Wayland
# clipboard on Kandelo too.
# The workspace [patch] also names four egui crates Cargo.lock does not
# use; vendoring skips them and an offline build stops on them.
